# Windows release version

A Windows installer uses the first version in `CHANGELOG.md`. Bump that version, and the same version in `meson.build`, before building the installer. Leave the previous number as its own section.

The window title already appends `Argus.VERSION`. Do not ship a Windows build on a version that was already installed.
